{%- comment -%}
  Deedap Fallback Product Tile
  Params:
    - cat_handle: category handle or name string
    - item_index: 0..4
    - tag: optional badge string
    - tint: fallback background colour
    - show_cat: bool
    - cat_label: string
    - cat_color: string
{%- endcomment -%}

